```java
// repeated parse + injection risk from concatenated input
try (Statement st = con.createStatement()) {
    for (String msg : messages) {                 // runs many times
        // the DB re-parses this SQL on every iteration
        st.executeUpdate("INSERT INTO audit (msg) VALUES ('" + msg + "')");
    }
}
```

```java
// parameterized + precompiled: safe and fast
try (PreparedStatement ps =
        con.prepareStatement("INSERT INTO audit (msg) VALUES (?)")) {
    for (String msg : messages) {
        ps.setString(1, msg);   // bound as DATA, no injection
        ps.addBatch();          // queue for one round-trip
    }
    ps.executeBatch();          // plan reused across all rows
}
```

*Prepared once, values bound as data, and batched into far fewer round-trips.*

